Here is the study in JSON format with logical operators:

```
{
  "AND": {
    "left": {
      "OR": {
        "left": {
          "raw_text": "Undergoing Interleukin-2 (IL-2) therapy"
        },
        "right": {
          "raw_text": "within 8 weeks of study entry"
        }
      }
    },
    "right": {
      "OR": {
        "left": {
          "raw_text": "Diagnosed with a medical"
        },
        "right": {
          "raw_text": "or psychiatric illness"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "right": {
    "raw_text": "that may interfere with study participation"
  }
},
{
  "AND": {
    "left": {
      "raw_text": "Pregnant"
    }
  }
}
```

Note that I've broken the study into two separate JSON objects, as the conditions are mutually exclusive. The first object represents the conditions related to IL-2 therapy and medical/psychiatric illnesses, while the second object represents the condition related to pregnancy.